WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Inspect paper measurements for CRAFTED CO₂/N₂. Total paid time includes setup and acquisition.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
With one query, acquisition is not repaid: Transport costs more in all three paired blocks.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
At 64 nearby queries, the median paid-time ratio is 0.500. All three blocks favor Transport.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Check a different relation and more distant operating conditions, using the same measured comparison.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
For NIST distant states and top 50, the median ratio is 1.029: reuse is not always faster.
